doc: StatGraveNoAbilities is a Continuous static's AffectedZone$ Graveyard RemoveAllAbilities$ True (Yixlid Jailer; CR 613.1f): each card in a graveyard that Filter matches loses all abilities while the static's battlefield source is in force. Zone is the graveyard and the filter reads the card as a card, wherever it lies. It is not a StatContinuous, so no battlefield reader (the layer walks, loss6) sees it; only the graveyard readers ask it, through graveAbilitiesLost (static_graveabilityloss.go), which also answers the removal's timestamp so a granted graveyard ability that is newer than the removal survives (gorge grantLostTo).
